# Only the main app, its database scripts, its font and the README are committed.
# Everything else at the repo root stays local: WIP/ (practice projects),
# Images/ (design images, screenshots) and Archives/ (zip backups).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/Cafe Solution/
!/Vintage Cafe SQL/
!/Pixelify_Sans/
!/README.md

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.vsidx

# Build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
*.pdb
*.cache

# NuGet
packages/
*.nupkg

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini